  "prefLabel": "Per 901.01 Assignment of Steps Within a Pay Band",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 901.01 Assignment of Steps Within a Pay Band. An appointing authority shall assign a step within each pay band established by the commissioner pursuant to RSA 99:1-a in accordance with the requirements of this part.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at chapter heading for Per 100) #8738, eff 10-18-06; ss by #10817, eff 5-17-15; ss by #14439, eff 12-1-25, EXPIRES: 12-1-35",
